@startuml SEQ_23_MELIHAT_MODUL_PRAKTIKUM
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-23: Melihat Modul Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as User
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "ModulPraktikumController"         as Controller
entity      "ModulPraktikum Model"             as Model

== Lihat Daftar Modul ==

User    -> Browser     : Buka tab Modul di halaman pertemuan/praktikum
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /praktikum/{id}/modul
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query modul berdasarkan praktikum
Model --> Controller   : Data modul
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar modul
Browser --> User       : Tampil daftar modul\n(view-only)

== Buka/Unduh Modul File PDF ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik modul bertipe file PDF
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /praktikum/modul/{id}/download
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query modul
Model --> Controller   : Data modul
Controller --> Browser : Download file PDF / tampilkan preview
Browser --> User       : File PDF diunduh / ditampilkan

== Buka Modul Link URL ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik modul bertipe link URL
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /praktikum/modul/{id}/redirect
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query modul
Model --> Controller   : Data URL
Controller --> Browser : Redirect ke URL eksternal
Browser --> User       : Tab baru membuka tautan eksternal

@enduml